    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Baxter Real Estate are delighted to present to the market, this 3-bedroom/1-bathroom, semi-detached bungalow, which occupies an area of approximately 56 sq.m./602 sq.ft. On entering this home, you are greeted by an entrance hall, which leads to the living room. This room has laminate flooring, a feature open fireplace, and a large picture window which bathes the room in natural light. The kitchen/dining room, located to the rear of the property, has vinyl flooring, a tiled splashback and a sliding door which opens to the private, sunny, south-facing rear garden. This garden features a large concrete shed, two patio areas, raised flower beds, and side access. This property has three bedrooms. Bedroom one has a large, mirrored fitted wardrobe and laminate flooring. Bedroom two has a fitted wardrobe and a carpeted floor, whilst bedroom three also features a carpeted floor. A fully tiled family bathroom, with an electric quadrant shower, heated towel rail and skylight, completes the accommodation. Additional features include gas-fired central heating with a 1-year old boiler, double-glazed uPVC windows, oak doors throughout, and off-street parking to the front. The property enjoys a highly convenient location close to the villages of Blanchardstown, Clonsilla and Ongar, with an extensive selection of amenities and services nearby. These include Connolly Hospital, the National Aquatic Centre, the Sport Ireland Campus, Draíocht Arts Centre, cafés, restaurants, schools and shops. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and Westend Retail Park are also within easy reach. Dublin Airport is less than a 20-minute drive away, while the nearby N3 provides quick and convenient access to the M50, Dublin City Centre and the wider national road network. The area is also well served by Dublin Bus, making this an excellent choice for commuters and families alike. Please note that all descriptions, boundaries, dimensions, references to condition, and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details, are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchaser should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact, but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. We have not tested any appliances, and all parties must undertake their own investigation into the condition of these appliances and to all other information provided.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living room - 3.53m (11'7\") x 3.52m (11'7\")\nLaminate flooring, feature open fire place and a large picture window.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 3.68m (12'1\") x 2.54m (8'4\")\nVinyl flooring, tiled splashback, and a sliding patio door opening to the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.49m (11'5\") x 2.73m (8'11\")\nLarge, mirrored fitted wardrobe and laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.72m (8'11\") x 2.54m (8'4\")\nFitted wardrobe and a carpeted floor.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.55m (8'4\") x 2.44m (8'0\")\nCarpeted floor.\n\nBathroom - 1.83m (6'0\") x 1.65m (5'5\")\nFully tiled, with an electric, quadrant shower, heated towel rail and skylight.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3-bedroom/1-bathroom semi-detached bungalow </li><li> Situated in a popular, family-friendly neighbourhood </li><li> Private sunny south-facing rear garden with side access </li><li> Large concrete shed </li><li> Gas central heating - new boiler </li><li> Double-glazed uPVC windows </li><li> Driveway providing off-street parking </li><li> Within walking distance of numerous amenities </li><li> Short drive to the M50 and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre </li><li> Area well-serviced by public transport</li></ul>"
      },
